    "aiBudgetAnswer": "Keep bride-family, groom-family, and couple pots separate. Record paid vs spent so pending deposits stay visible. Jewellery hire often sits on the groom side.",
    "aiWhatsapp": "What do we send on WhatsApp?",
    "aiWhatsappAnswer": "Date, guest count with a 10–12% buffer, ceremony types (poruwa / nikah / church), and whether you are planning from overseas. Keep Amma on the thread.",
